@startuml sl-00-end-to-end
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam conditionStyle inside

title Main Flow — End-to-End Operational Lifecycle Overview

|Storage Customer|
start
:Browse facilities and select unit type;
:Submit reservation request with rental dates (BR-GEN-03);

|System|
:Check capacity availability (BR-AVL-01);
:Hold capacity slot for 48 hours (BR-DEP-03, BR-RES-02);

|Storage Customer|
:Review quote & pay deposit and first month via VNPay Sandbox (BR-PAY-01);

|System|
:Verify payment & mark Reservation CONFIRMED;

|Facility Manager|
:Review confirmed reservation & assign physical storage unit (BR-AVL-04);

|System|
:Generate RentalContract (PENDING_CHECK_IN) & Move-in Pass;

|Storage Customer|
:Arrive at facility on scheduled check-in date;

|Facility Staff|
:Verify customer ID/Pass and inspect storage unit (BR-CHK-01, BR-CHK-02);
:Sign electronic handover protocol;

|System|
:Activate contract (ACTIVE) and issue 6-digit PIN code (BR-CHK-03);

|Storage Customer|
:Use storage unit with secure access PIN;

if (Customer decides to renew?) then (yes)
  |Storage Customer|
  :Request online contract renewal (T-20 to T-3 window) (BR-REN-01);
  |System|
  :Verify unit availability and process renewal payment (BR-REN-04);
  :Extend contract end date;
else (no / overdue)
  if (Rental contract reaches end date without renewal?) then (overdue)
    |System|
    :Trigger Overdue Cron at 00:00:00 (BR-OVD-01);
    :Transition contract to OVERDUE;
    :Apply daily late penalties & notify customer (BR-OVD-02);
  else (return)
    |Storage Customer|
    :Submit return request with appointment date (BR-RET-01);
  endif
endif

|Facility Staff|
:Conduct exit checkout inspection (cleanliness, damages) (BR-RET-04);
:Submit return inspection report;

|Facility Manager|
:Review and approve final return settlement (BR-RET-07);

|System|
:Process deposit refund or debt settlement (BR-RET-08);
:Transition contract to RETURNED / CLOSED;
:Transition storage unit to CLEANING then AVAILABLE (BR-RET-09);

|Storage Customer|
:Receive final settlement statement & deposit refund;
stop
@enduml

